WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:18,820
That's how it is

2
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:48,060
Dad is back

3
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:54,380
You must be hungry, come on, brother

4
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:56,340
You said you would come back to see me when the peach trees bloom

5
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,300
The peach tree blooms every year and you never come back

6
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:01,060
I thought you lied to me, but I didn’t lie to you.

7
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:02,620
Just a little busy

8
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:07,550
Brother is back this time

9
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:15,780
It seems like I don’t plan to leave, brother

10
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:19,560
Is something okay?

11
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:32,650
Have you found it? Elder Bing Taishang

12
00:01:32,890 --> 00:01:34,890
Li Mo moved his family's traces throughout the house in advance

13
00:01:34,890 --> 00:01:39,690
Cut the grass and roots and continue to investigate. Li Mo is still being investigated. There is currently no news to investigate.

14
00:01:40,450 --> 00:01:42,290
The twenty-five-year-old day after tomorrow

15
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:44,850
This girl can run better than I thought
